# CarnetSats secrets — copy to .env and fill in. NEVER commit .env.
# .env is gitignored. Never paste these values in chat, in a video, or in
# a Devpost submission. run.sh creates .env with a fresh merchant key on
# first start if it is missing.

# Real Lightning wallet (v3.7 rev4). A nostr+walletconnect:// URL from a
# TESTNET wallet (Alby testnet / LNbits testnet). Scope your NWC connection
# to receive-only (do not grant `pay_invoice`) in Alby Hub — still keep
# `.env` private, since the URL can create invoices and read the balance.
# Leave it unset (or delete the line) and the
# app runs in demo mode (local BOLT11, local settle) exactly as before.
# CARNETSATS_NWC_URL="nostr+walletconnect://<wallet_pubkey_hex>?relay=wss://relay.example.com&secret=<client_secret_hex>"

# Merchant signing key for Nostr credit events (64 hex chars). If unset,
# the app falls back to the fixed demo secret (labelled "demo" in
# /api/state). run.sh generates a fresh one into .env automatically.
# CARNETSATS_MERCHANT_KEY=

# Cold-vault watch-only key (BIP-84 account vpub, m/84'/1'/0'). If unset,
# the app uses the demo vpub. Production: the boutique's own vpub from
# its hardware signer (Coldcard / SeedSigner).
# CARNETSATS_VPUB=

# Public relay for Nostr credit-event publishing (default wss://relay.damus.io).
# CARNETSATS_RELAY_URL=wss://relay.damus.io
# Set to 0 to disable automatic relay publishing after each sale.
# CARNETSATS_RELAY_PUBLISH=1

# SQLite database path (default carnetsats.db next to the app).
# CARNETSATS_DB=

# Groq AI key for the boutique sale parser (v3.8). Free tier, no card:
# create it at https://console.groq.com/keys. If unset, the parser
# uses the deterministic fallback and the app works exactly as before.
# Never paste the key in chat, in a video, or in a Devpost submission.
# GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_...
